Priority: optional
Maintainer: kawaiipantsu <12233528+kawaiipantsu@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/kawaiipantsu/susfile
Installed-Size: 8192
Description: CLI file-forensics visualiser
 susfile reads one file and shows what it is: magic header, MIME and detected
 type, size and timestamps, MD5/SHA-1/SHA-256, ELF/PE/Mach-O structure, Shannon
 entropy and ent-style statistics.
 .
 Its centrepiece is a "file map": the whole file drawn as a grid of block cells
 where the glyph names the content class found in that region (source, printable
 text, machine code, compressed, encrypted, padding, ...) and the colour encodes
 the region's entropy. Packers, appended payloads and embedded archives stand
 out at a glance.
 .
 susfile is a single static binary. It makes no network connections and sends no
 telemetry.
